{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{"prompts":{"listChanged":true},"tools":{"listChanged":true}},"serverInfo":{"name":"good-grants-mcp","version":"1.0.0","title":"Good Grants MCP by usefulapi","websiteUrl":"https://usefulapi.io/good-grants/","icons":[{"src":"https://usefulapi.io/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml","sizes":["any"]},{"src":"https://usefulapi.io/icon-256.png","mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["256x256"]}]},"instructions":"Tools for Good Grants, hosted by usefulapi.io. If the user is new or asks what this server can do, suggest requests such as: \"Which applications are waiting for review in our current round?\"; \"Show the top 10 applications on the leaderboard for our main score set.\"; \"How much budget is still available in our main fund?\". Read-only tools never change data; ask the user before a tool that creates, changes or deletes Good Grants data. Free plan: 50 tool calls per month. Run goodgrants_usage_status to see the calls used this month. If the user asks for something none of these tools can do, tell the user and, with their OK, run goodgrants_request_feature to record the request. Paid plans: Pro (10,000 tool calls a month, $9/month or $90/year, for normal use) and Pro+ (100,000 tool calls a month, $39/month or $390/year, for automations and heavy use). A plan can be cancelled at any time and then runs to the end of the paid period, so it also suits a one-time job. When the user wants more calls or reaches the limit, run goodgrants_upgrade without a plan: it returns both plans, each with a payment link for the user to open. goodgrants_cancel_subscription cancels Pro at the end of the paid period.","tools":[{"name":"goodgrants_get_account","title":"Get account","description":"Get the Good Grants account for the API key: name, region, default language and identifiers.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{}},"annotations":{"title":"